data/corpfiling/AttachLive/51829a4b-bcb0-4d54-9d45-da2965bdbfbd.pdf"},{"symbol":"CRYOGENIC","ticker":"CRYOGENIC","company":"Cryogenic Ogs Ltd","event_type":"order_win","quantum":"Rs 19.36 cr per the filing; ~3.5% of mcap","headline":"wins its **first independent export order in piping spools, USD 20,22,816 or Rs 19.36 crore at the filing's rate**, from a global EPC contractor in bulk liquid storage","amount_rs":null,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/05b732a3-c741-4353-a19e-1f4f6c5afa8b.pdf","mcap":552.3,"doc":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/05b732a3-c741-4353-a19e-1f4f6c5afa8b.pdf"}],"themes":{"order_wins":["**BEML** — secures an order **valued at over Rs 5,400 crore from National High Speed Rail Corporation** for the supply and maintenance of high-speed rolling stock and allied works on the Mumbai-Ahmedabad corridor, which it calls normal course of business _(~32.2% of mcap, our arithmetic)_.","**Highway Infrastructure** — receives a **letter of acceptance from the Uttar Pradesh Expressways Industrial Development Authority for toll collection on the Gorakhpur Link Expressway, Rs 220.66 crore over two years**, with four patrol-cum-safety vehicles _(~71.4% of mcap)_.","**KS Smart Technologies** — wholly owned KS Smart Solutions **bags a Rs 127.12 crore project from the Punjab School Education Department**, 16,250 mid-level desktops and 15,788 line-interactive UPS units installed in schools by January 2027 _(~7.0% of mcap)_.","**DMR Engineering** — as 51% lead of a joint venture with Shri Balaji Hydro Construction, receives a **Rs 70 crore letter of award from Arun Shakti Energy** for the coffer dam and barrage of the 24.60 MW Kamlang hydro project, in 780 days _(~236.5% of mcap)_.","**Cryogenic OGS** — wins its **first independently secured export order in piping spools, USD 20,22,816 or Rs 19.36 crore at the filing's stated rate of 95.73**, from a global EPC contractor in bulk liquid storage, for execution in 12-20 weeks _(~3.5% of mcap)_.","**Siyaram Recycling Industries** — secures a **Rs 2.19 crore order for brass ingots from Metal Scrap India**, a fixed-cost order to be executed within seven days _(~3.0% of mcap)_."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**Rossell Techsys** — board approves issuing **25,72,898 shares at Rs 1,166 to SBI Mutual Fund and SBI Optimal Equity Fund for Rs 299.99 crore**, 6.39% of the company, with an extraordinary general meeting set for 15 October _(~5.9% of mcap)_.","**Pritika Engineering Components** — shareholders approve issuing **50,00,000 shares at Rs 64 to promoter Pritika Auto Industries against an outstanding unsecured loan**, plus 12,00,000 shares and 4,00,000 warrants at the same price to non-promoters for cash."],"m_and_a":["**Gujarat Themis Biosyn** — **completes the purchase of 100% of MicroBiopharm Japan from T Capital Partners funds for JPY 21.5 billion**, funding its Japanese subsidiary with Rs 475 crore of capital and a loan agreement of up to Rs 800 crore.","**Sky Gold and Diamonds** — board approves buying **100% of Purvi Gems & Jewellery (India) for up to Rs 9 crore in cash** by 30 November; the target turned over Rs 103.40 crore in FY26 on provisional figures _(~0.1% of mcap)_.","**TCM** — signs a **binding MoU with Asset Homes and investor Suhas Nandan to form an SPV, Asset TCM Estates**, for a premium villa project on TCM's 250 cents at Kalamassery; the investor is to lend the SPV Rs 25 crore at 20% a year.","**Ashika Global Securities** — **incorporates two wholly owned subsidiaries to run a mutual fund**, Ashika Global Asset Management with Rs 60 crore of paid-up capital and Ashika Global Trustee with Rs 10 lakh; operations await SEBI approval."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 3 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**Dr. Reddy's Laboratories** — signs an **exclusive agreement to distribute and market Takeda's dengue vaccine Qdenga in India's private market**, with no upfront or milestone payment; Takeda keeps the public market and manufacturing, availability expected in first-half 2027.","**Skyways Air Services** — reports **Q1 FY27 consolidated revenue of Rs 1,216.53 crore, up 92.8%, and profit of Rs 26.79 crore, up 143.3%**, with domestic air-freight share at 6.2% from 5.9%, and declares its first interim dividend of Re 0.25.","**Cochin Shipyard** — its 10 September investor-call transcript puts **first-quarter turnover at Rs 1,094.21 crore and profit after tax at Rs 151.45 crore**, against Rs 1,068.59 crore and Rs 187.82 crore a year earlier, on three vessels delivered.","**Larsen & Toubro** — wholly owned L&T Semiconductor Technologies **unveils 40 products at SEMICON India 2026**, including its first 1200V silicon-carbide MOSFET platform and the tape-out of a designed-in-India BLDC motor controller.","**Indian Emulsifiers** — signs a **non-binding MoU giving Spice Lounge Food Works exclusive India offtake, branding and distribution of its coming food-grade emulsifier line**, about 200 tonnes a month, indicatively for five years from commissioning.","**Spice Lounge Food Works** — the counterparty to that MoU, **puts the cumulative revenue potential at about Rs 500 crore over the first three years**, an internal indicative estimate it states is not a forecast and is subject to definitive agreements."],"distress_risk":["**SJVN** — BSE and NSE **fine it for non-compliance on board composition, audit and nomination committee constitution and board quorum** to the June 2026 quarter; the board replies that only the Ministry of Power can appoint its directors.","**Satiate Agri** — the **first meeting of its committee of creditors is called for 21 September**, under the corporate insolvency resolution process."],"other_notable":["**Capital Infra Trust** — its investment manager approves applying **the whole Rs 124.99 crore of proceeds from a proposed preferential unit issue to shareholder loans letting the target SPVs repay senior and sponsor debt**, with nil to acquisitions."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","other_notable":"Other notable"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"label":"BEML","ticker":"BEML","company":"BEML Limited","isin":"INE258A01016","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BEML_18092026091443_SE_Letter_180926.pdf","mcap":16768.6},{"label":"HILINFRA","ticker":"HILINFRA","company":"Highway Infrastructure Limited","isin":"INE00RL01028","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/HIGHWAY123_18092026101738_HIL_PressRelease_18092026.pdf","mcap":308.9},{"label":"KSSMART","ticker":"KSSMART","company":"KS Smart Technologies Ltd","isin":"INE737E01011","pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/b9109551-a4a7-40ac-b4b2-1cdbd0c2644f.pdf","mcap":1813.0},{"label":"DMR","ticker":"DMR","company":"DMR Engineering Ltd","isin":"INE07L501010","pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/51829a4b-bcb0-4d54-9d45-da2965bdbfbd.pdf","mcap":29.6},{"label":"CRYOGENIC","ticker":"CRYOGENIC","company":"Cryogenic Ogs Ltd","isin":"INE0TL001013","pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/05b732a3-c741-4353-a19e-1f4f6c5afa8b.pdf","mcap":552.3},{"label":"Siyaram Recycling Industries Ltd","ticker":"SIYARAM","company":"Siyaram Recycling Industries Ltd","isin":"","pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/0d76a0e5-2314-414a-97aa-ffea65844363.pdf","mcap":73.8}],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":[{"label":"ROSSTECH","ticker":"ROSSTECH","company":"Rossell Techsys Limited","isin":"INE0OJW01016","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/9886945009_1809202612